      "title": "Burn Her Mother's Legacy",
      "start_block": "B007",
      "end_block": "B034",
      "hook": "Juliana, dragged by guards, screams desperately at Catherine: 'Catherine! Please! That book is my mother's only legacy!'",
      "cliffhanger": "Catherine leans in and whispers the threat: '...no one will remember what was written inside.'",
      "why": "A cruel villain publicly threatens to destroy a weeping victim's only family heirloom, ending on a chilling unresolved threat.",
      "context_gap": "Why Juliana is being arrested and why the book matters to Catherine."
    },
    {
      "title": "Your Scarred Soldier Can't Save You",
      "start_block": "B043",
      "end_block": "B073",
      "hook": "Juliana raises her chin and declares with steely resolve: 'My husband will find me.'",
      "cliffhanger": "The massive iron portcullis crashes down as Juliana stands alone in the damp dungeon cell.",
      "why": "A defiant wife's faith in her husband is mocked, then she is locked away, ending on a final, isolating visual cliffhanger.",
      "context_gap": "Who Alexander is and why Catherine believes he is powerless."
    },
    {
      "title": "They Will Not Take Him",
      "start_block": "B057",
      "end_block": "B074",
      "hook": "Juliana kneels on the wet stone floor, hyperventilating and clutching her chest in terror.",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana stands dignified in the dungeon, gazing upward as she vows: 'They will not take Alexander from me.'",
      "why": "A raw emotional breakdown transforms into unbreakable resolve, ending on a powerful vow that leaves her fate hanging.",
      "context_gap": "Who Alexander is and why Juliana's loyalty to him is her final source of strength."
    }
  ],
